image_description = "Stylized fantasy card illustration, painterly digital art with clean bold shapes and soft cel-shaded lighting, whimsical and expressive young-adult tone like a modern indie RPG, rich saturated colors with a warm key light and colored shadows, a single clear focal subject with a readable silhouette, simple atmospheric background, slight exaggeration for comedy. Vertical 2:3 portrait composition for a full-art trading card: main subject in the upper-middle of the frame, fully visible, head and key details within the upper 60%; top 10% uncluttered; lower third calmer and less detailed (soft background, ground, or atmosphere) so rules text can overlay it; keep important elements away from the outer edges. No text, no letters, no card frame, no border. Blend the Necrocrat accent (cool grays, sickly green highlights, paperwork) with the Beefcake accent (sunny gold, warm red, gym motifs). A skeletal clerk in a sweatband and a tie bench-pressing a filing cabinet, iron dumbbells stacked on an in-tray, red tape coiling around the barbell, green office light meeting warm gym light."
